CPU SNAP inner-switch regression case.

The atoms are inside the smooth inner-switch interval (0.8 to 1.2 Angstrom).
This case verifies model-file parsing and the complete MD energy, force, and
stress path with switchinnerflag enabled. The coefficients are a deterministic
software-test fixture, not a validated physical potential.

The reference was cross-checked with LAMMPS SNAP (30 Mar 2026 development
build, c46bbef): potential energy -0.24612388 eV, x forces -2.7962 and
+2.7962 eV/Angstrom, and Pxx 3999.6081 bar. ABACUS reports Pxx in kbar.

Model files: ../../SIMULATION_MODELS/snap_104_inner.coeff and
../../SIMULATION_MODELS/snap_104_inner.param.
